    "name": "Legion Was Here",
    "steam_appid": 3492120,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Legion</strong>, a secret agent who can <strong>modify his appearance at will</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agencies <strong>from all around the world</strong> call on your chameleon skills to carry out <strong>dangerous missions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To approach your targets, you must succeed in passing yourself off as one of their loved ones: become a husband, a brother, a son\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The possibilities are endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: the slightest misstep can mean\u2026 <strong>Death</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u25cf Change your look</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the operating room to customize Legion's appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/68f71a7431c6651fabf1834c75001da0.poster.avif?t=1754827066\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/68f71a7431c6651fabf1834c75001da0.webm?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/68f71a7431c6651fabf1834c75001da0.mp4?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age, hairstyle, nose, eye color\u2026 <strong>Everything can be changed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right look for your mission, among more than <strong>900 million combinations</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u25cf Investigate</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A file detailing your new identity will be provided to you for each mission. By cross-referencing its documents, you will have to find the appropriate appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/4c3bc20f6b339a69178d4bce4d3fbb24.poster.avif?t=1754827066\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/4c3bc20f6b339a69178d4bce4d3fbb24.webm?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/4c3bc20f6b339a69178d4bce4d3fbb24.mp4?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be thorough, as <strong>each document is important</strong>\u2026 Yes, even this chocolate bar wrapper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u25cf Go on your mission</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have the correct look, you will be able to <strong>approach your target</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/320cea5aa01dcd5594387eb58d750e97.poster.avif?t=1754827066\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/320cea5aa01dcd5594387eb58d750e97.webm?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/320cea5aa01dcd5594387eb58d750e97.mp4?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the mission doesn't end there: you will also have to act in accordance with your new identity to gain his trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phase uses <strong>visual novel</strong> mechanics, with multiple choice questions that will test your acting skills\u2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The file you have studied will help you in your task... As well as the notes you have taken care to write on your left hand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u261e Legion Was Here is also</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>3-4 hours of play</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A wide variety of missions</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apart from the usual spy agencies (FBI, MI6...), you will sometimes have to deal with more unusual clients - ghosts from the past or amusement park mascots, everyone can hire Legion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The perfect agent</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will always be able to redo missions to improve your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you don't reach 100%, you weren't totally credible...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay vigilant, as <strong>the missions won't unfold the same way every time</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>About the developer</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game made entirely solo (except for <strong>the saxophone</strong>, played by my friend Pierre) and without recourse to AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning :</strong> Some sequences in this game contain flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in sensitive individuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>Legion</strong>, a secret agent who can <strong>modify his appearance at will</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agencies <strong>from all around the world</strong> call on your chameleon skills to carry out <strong>dangerous missions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To approach your targets, you must succeed in passing yourself off as one of their loved ones: become a husband, a brother, a son\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The possibilities are endless</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful: the slightest misstep can mean\u2026 <strong>Death</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u25cf Change your look</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the operating room to customize Legion's appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/68f71a7431c6651fabf1834c75001da0.poster.avif?t=1754827066\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/68f71a7431c6651fabf1834c75001da0.webm?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/68f71a7431c6651fabf1834c75001da0.mp4?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age, hairstyle, nose, eye color\u2026 <strong>Everything can be changed</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the right look for your mission, among more than <strong>900 million combinations</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u25cf Investigate</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A file detailing your new identity will be provided to you for each mission. By cross-referencing its documents, you will have to find the appropriate appearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/4c3bc20f6b339a69178d4bce4d3fbb24.poster.avif?t=1754827066\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/4c3bc20f6b339a69178d4bce4d3fbb24.webm?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/4c3bc20f6b339a69178d4bce4d3fbb24.mp4?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be thorough, as <strong>each document is important</strong>\u2026 Yes, even this chocolate bar wrapper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>\u25cf Go on your mission</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have the correct look, you will be able to <strong>approach your target</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/320cea5aa01dcd5594387eb58d750e97.poster.avif?t=1754827066\" width=600 height=356 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/320cea5aa01dcd5594387eb58d750e97.webm?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492120/extras/320cea5aa01dcd5594387eb58d750e97.mp4?t=1754827066\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful, the mission doesn't end there: you will also have to act in accordance with your new identity to gain his trust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This phase uses <strong>visual novel</strong> mechanics, with multiple choice questions that will test your acting skills\u2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The file you have studied will help you in your task... As well as the notes you have taken care to write on your left hand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u261e Legion Was Here is also</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>3-4 hours of play</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>A wide variety of missions</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apart from the usual spy agencies (FBI, MI6...), you will sometimes have to deal with more unusual clients - ghosts from the past or amusement park mascots, everyone can hire Legion!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>The perfect agent</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will always be able to redo missions to improve your score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As long as you don't reach 100%, you weren't totally credible...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But stay vigilant, as <strong>the missions won't unfold the same way every time</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>About the developer</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game made entirely solo (except for <strong>the saxophone</strong>, played by my friend Pierre) and without recourse to AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning :</strong> Some sequences in this game contain flashing lights and visual effects that may trigger seizures in sensitive individuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
